{"id": "35669", "title": "建国大业", "author": "王兴东 陈宝光", "category": "文学名著", "count": 43, "available": 11, "cover": "files/article/image/35/35669/35669s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/35/35669.htm", "intro": "讲述了从1945年抗日战争结束到1949年建国前夕过程中发生的一系列故事，影片以第一届全国政协会议的筹备为主线，反映了新中国成立前夕的那段风云岁月。导演黄建新表示，本片较之以往的主旋律电影有新的突破，其中一些鲜为人知的故事被挖掘和表现，其中就有蒋介石与蒋经国父子之间关系的深入描写。", "base": "files/article/html/35/35669", "chapters": [{"title": "第一章　首倡新政协毛泽东城南庄涉险 横跨大西洋冯玉祥胜利号遇难", "volume": true}, {"title": "01", "file": "2545707.html", "available": false}, {"title": "02", "file": "2545709.html", "available": false}, {"title": "03", "file": "2545711.html", "available": false}, {"title": "04", "file": "2545713.html", "available": false}, {"title": "05", "file": "2545715.html", "available": false}, {"title": "06", "file": "2545718.html", "available": false}, {"title": "07", "file": "2545720.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章　毛泽东决策第四野战军攻锦州 何香凝促驾李济深北上赴大连", "volume": true}, {"title": "01", "file": "2545723.html", "available": false}, {"title": "02", "file": "2545725.html", "available": false}, {"title": "03", "file": "2545727.html", "available": false}, {"title": "04", "file": "2545729.html", "available": false}, {"title": "05", "file": "2545731.html", "available": false}, {"title": "06", "file": "2545733.html", "available": false}, {"title": "07", "file": "2545736.html", "available": false}, {"title": "08", "file": "2545738.html", "available": false}, {"title": "09", "file": "2545741.html", "available": false}, {"title": "09", "file": "2545743.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章　蒋介石求和划江而治终成画饼 张治中谈判精诚所至长留北平", "volume": true}, {"title": "01", "file": "2545746.html", "available": false}, {"title": "02", "file": "2545748.html", "available": false}, {"title": "03", "file": "2545750.html", "available": false}, {"title": "04", "file": "2545752.html", "available": false}, {"title": "05", "file": "2545754.html", "available": false}, {"title": "06", "file": "2545756.html", "availab